<!-- wp:group {"className":"ifm-legal__body"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group ifm-legal__body"><!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"who-we-are","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="who-we-are"><span>01</span> Who we are</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>This website is run by Mehreen, a sole trader trading as IamFamous ("we", "us"). Our postal address is 27 Old Gloucester Street, London, WC1N 3AX, United Kingdom and our email is <a href="mailto:support@iamfamous.uk">support@iamfamous.uk</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>"You" means the person or business placing the order. If you order for a business, you confirm you are allowed to do so.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"the-contract","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="the-contract"><span>02</span> How the contract is made</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A package page describes what is included, what is not, the delivery time, the changes included and the price. When you place an order and we send your order confirmation by email, a contract is formed on these terms and on the description of the package you bought.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If a package page and these terms disagree, the package page applies to that package.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"prices","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="prices"><span>03</span> Prices and payment</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Prices are in pounds sterling. We are not registered for VAT, so no VAT is added. Payment is taken in full at checkout through a third-party payment provider. We do not see or store your card details.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Some packages rely on things you buy from others in your own name, such as a domain name, hosting, paid software or advertising spend. Those costs are not included and are paid by you directly to the supplier.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Monthly packages cover one month of work. They are not subscriptions and do not renew.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"your-part","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="your-part"><span>04</span> What we need from you</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each package lists what we need. You agree to provide it accurately and promptly, and to give access by user invite where access is needed. Please never send us a password.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You confirm you have the right to use the text, images, logos and other material you send us, and that our using it for your order will not infringe anyone else's rights.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"delivery","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="delivery"><span>05</span> Delivery times</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The delivery time shown on a package starts when we have everything listed under "What we need from you". If we are waiting for something from you, the delivery time is paused until we receive it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Delivery times are our honest estimate of working days, Monday to Friday, excluding UK public holidays. If we expect to be late, we will tell you and explain why. If we are more than 10 working days late for reasons within our control, you may cancel the undelivered part and be refunded for it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"changes","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="changes"><span>06</span> Changes and revisions</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each package states the changes or revisions included. A round of changes is one list sent together. Requests outside the scope of the package are quoted separately, and we only go ahead if you accept the price.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"extras","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="extras"><span>07</span> Optional extras</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Some packages offer optional extras at checkout. An extra round of changes adds one round to those included in the package. Express delivery moves your order to the front of our queue, and we aim to deliver in half the stated delivery time. If an express order takes longer than the standard delivery time shown on the package, we refund the express fee. Extras are not offered on monthly packages.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"results","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="results"><span>08</span> What we do and do not promise</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We promise to carry out the work listed on your package with reasonable care and skill, and to deliver what the package describes.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not promise results that depend on others. This includes positions in Google or other search engines, mentions by AI tools, numbers of visitors, followers, enquiries or sales, and whether a third-party site keeps, labels or indexes a link. Search engines, advertising platforms and other websites make their own decisions and change their rules without notice.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"links","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="links"><span>09</span> Links and listings on other websites</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Where a package includes links or listings, we replace free of charge any that are not live when we deliver. Guest posts removed within 90 days of publication are replaced. After that, placements are outside our control.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"ownership","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="ownership"><span>10</span> Who owns the work</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Once you have paid in full, you own the final work we create for you, such as your website, designs and written content. Material you gave us stays yours. We keep the right to use our own methods, templates and tools, and third-party software, fonts and images stay subject to their own licences.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We will not show your work in our own marketing or name you as a customer without asking first.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"cancelling","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="cancelling"><span>11</span> Cancelling and refunds</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You can cancel before work starts and receive a full refund. Once work has started, refunds follow our <a href="/refund-policy/">refund policy</a>, which forms part of these terms.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you are a consumer, you also have a legal right to cancel within 14 days of your order. By placing an order and sending your project details, you ask us to start work within that period. If you then cancel within the 14 days, you pay for the work done up to the point you told us. Once a service has been fully carried out, the right to cancel ends.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"liability","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="liability"><span>12</span> Our responsibility to you</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot legally be limited, including liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, or for fraud. If you are a consumer, nothing here affects your legal rights.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Subject to that, we are not liable for loss of profit, business or data, or for losses we could not reasonably have foreseen, and our total liability for an order is limited to the price you paid for it. We are not responsible for the actions of third parties such as search engines, advertising platforms, hosting companies or publishers.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"ending","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="ending"><span>13</span> Ending an order early</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may stop work and refund the part not delivered if we cannot get the information or access we need after asking twice, if you ask us to do something unlawful or against a platform's rules, or if you are abusive to our team.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"general","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="general"><span>14</span> Data, complaints and the law</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We handle personal information as described in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you are unhappy, email <a href="mailto:support@iamfamous.uk">support@iamfamous.uk</a> with your order number. We reply within one working day and aim to resolve complaints within 10 working days.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales have jurisdiction. If you are a consumer living in Scotland or Northern Ireland, you may also bring a claim in your local courts.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may update these terms. The version in force when you order applies to that order.</p>
